      "description": "🌕 CLEAN THE MOON 🧹\n\nThe Moon is a total mess, and you’re the only one who can fix it!\n\nSuit up, grab your broom, and sweep moon dust, space junk, and meteor debris across the lunar surface. Sell what you collect, upgrade your gear, and build a base that cleans the Moon for you!\n\n🧹 Sweep dust and debris to earn cash\n🤖 Unlock cleaning robots to automate your work\n🏗️ Build and expand your own lunar base\n⚡ Upgrade your broom, backpack, and moon boots\n🌑 Unlock new craters and zones as you progress\n👨‍🚀 Team up with friends to clean faster together\n\nCan you clean the ENTIRE Moon? 🌍\n\n\n🖨️Your progress on your moon saves!\n👍 Like and ⭐ Favorite for new updates!\n🔔 Join the group for exclusive rewards!\n\nTags: Clean The Moon, Sweep The Moon, Moon, Space, Sweep, Clean, Dust, Vacuum, Robots, Conveyor, Simulator, Incremental, Upgrade, Peel The Potato, Search For The Needle, Punch To Escape",
